ce.\n\nThus we might still recommend B, but we need to address the lack of evidence. We could ask for more info on other candidates' cooperation from other panel members. But we need to make a contribution now.\n\nWe could say: I still lean toward B because his strengths in reliability, stress handling, technical competence are critical, and while his cooperation concerns are noted, the other candidates have equally or more serious cooperation deficits (A's communication difficulty, C's unfriendly, D's loner). Therefore B remains provisional lead, but we need to gather more evidence on cooperation for all.\n\nThus vote remains Candidate B.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 2's point and our own facts.\n\nProceed."}
